      "description": "A scene composed of a woman with visible physical injuries (bruising around her mouth and eye) and text overlaid on the image. The text reads 'women ask for equal rights, and this is why,' framing the woman's suffering as the reason for the demand for equal rights. The woman is the central visual entity, and the text is positioned at the top and bottom of the image, directly relating to her condition.",
