      "instance_name": "pity_narrative",
      "label": "Pity Narrative",
      "description": "A narrative that frames a person's struggle or suffering as something to be pitied or sympathized with, rather than as part of a broader social or political movement. The meme uses the woman's injuries to evoke sympathy, which can be seen as a form of pity narrative.",
