      "@type": "BackgroundKnowledge",
      "instance_name": "objectification",
      "label": "Objectification",
      "description": "The act of treating a person as an object or commodity, rather than as a person with agency and dignity. The meme risks objectifying the woman by reducing her to her injuries and portraying her as a symbol of the need for equal rights, rather than as an individual with her own agency.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
